1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,200
You cheaters!

2
00:00:01,733 --> 00:00:03,033
[JUNE] Get off him!

3
00:00:03,033 --> 00:00:04,467
Ouch!

4
00:00:04,467 --> 00:00:06,100
I'll deal with you later.

5
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,400
Fine!

6
00:00:08,533 --> 00:00:09,800
And you...

7
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:12,133
I wasn't even gone that long,
and you're already flirting.

8
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,100
Are you jealous?

9
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:17,233
[INHALES DEEPLY, CLEARS THROAT]

10
00:00:17,233 --> 00:00:18,567
Silence means yes.

11
00:00:18,567 --> 00:00:20,500
- You're jealous, aren't--
- Fine!

12
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:23,233
I'm jealous, okay? Happy?

13
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,467
Why would you be jealous of her?
Come on.

14
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:29,967
She's not even my type.

15
00:00:30,633 --> 00:00:32,400
I don't like gold diggers,
remember?

16
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:36,500
Sorry.

17
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:39,600
I judged you too quickly.

18
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:43,033
Now I get why you don't trust
people easily.

19
00:00:43,033 --> 00:00:45,100
Your brother has betrayed you
so many times.

20
00:00:46,067 --> 00:00:48,067
In my family, no one...

21
00:00:48,567 --> 00:00:50,067
would ever do that to me.

22
00:00:50,733 --> 00:00:52,300
They keep asking you for money

23
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:54,367
even though they know
you have nothing left.

24
00:00:54,367 --> 00:00:55,767
Isn't that basically stealing?

25
00:00:57,100 --> 00:01:01,200
They could work for a living
instead of depending on you.

26
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:04,500
[GENTLE MUSIC PLAYING]

27
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:05,600
Alright.

28
00:01:06,133 --> 00:01:08,233
Next time, give me
a knock on the head

29
00:01:08,267 --> 00:01:10,667
when you feel like people
are taking advantage of me.

30
00:01:11,467 --> 00:01:16,733
And do the same for me if I ever
become hard-hearted again.

31
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:19,233
But don't hit me for real, okay?

32
00:01:19,233 --> 00:01:21,367
- I'll just pinch you instead.
- [GRUNTS]

33
00:01:21,367 --> 00:01:24,133
- I literally just said it.
- [PHONE RINGING]

34
00:01:25,533 --> 00:01:26,633
- Speak of the devil.
- [PING CHUCKLES]

35
00:01:26,633 --> 00:01:28,600
[PHONE RINGING]

36
00:01:30,067 --> 00:01:31,067
[PHONE BEEPS]

37
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:33,333
Hello.

38
00:01:33,333 --> 00:01:34,500
[DENNIS] Hello, June.

39
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:36,467
<i>I was wondering about
the money for my dentures.</i>

40
00:01:37,733 --> 00:01:39,600
[INHALES]

41
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:40,633
[CLEARS THROAT]

42
00:01:41,333 --> 00:01:42,733
I hope you don't just
remember me

43
00:01:42,733 --> 00:01:44,667
every time you need money.

44
00:01:45,233 --> 00:01:48,833
I'm sorry, but
I have nothing to give you.

45
00:01:50,633 --> 00:01:52,100
[DENNIS]
<i> You're so full of yourself!</i>

46
00:01:52,567 --> 00:01:54,133
<i> Fine! You're on your own!</i>

47
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:58,167
[CHUCKLES SOFTLY, CLAPS]

48
00:01:58,167 --> 00:02:00,067
I did it!

49
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:04,467
[SQUEALS WITH DELIGHT]

50
00:02:06,433 --> 00:02:08,333
- [SQUEALS]
- [CHUCKLES]

51
00:02:08,333 --> 00:02:15,333
[SOFT MUSIC PLAYING]

52
00:02:22,500 --> 00:02:23,467
[PHONE BEEPS]

53
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:26,100
[LINE RINGING]

54
00:02:26,533 --> 00:02:27,567
[PING] Hello, To.

55
00:02:28,633 --> 00:02:29,833
Come here tomorrow.

56
00:02:31,867 --> 00:02:33,233
Let's settle this issue.

57
00:02:33,233 --> 00:02:34,400
[CHUCKLES SOFTLY]

58
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:41,367
[SOFT MUSIC CONTINUES]
